{"speciesId":607,"names":{"fr":"Funécire","es":"Litwick","en":"Litwick","ja":"ヒトモシ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa flamme brûle en consumant l’énergie vitale des gens et des Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Litwick shines a light that absorbs the life energy of people and Pokémon, which becomes the fuel that it burns."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il fait semblant de guider ses victimes à la lueur de sa flamme, mais c’est pour mieux aspirer leur énergie vitale."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"While shining a light and pretending to be a guide, it leeches off the life force of any who follow it."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its flame is usually out, but it starts shining when it absorbs life force from people or Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its flame is usually out, but it starts shining when it absorbs life force from people or Pokémon."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il fait semblant de guider ses victimes à la lueur de sa flamme, mais c’est pour mieux aspirer leur énergie vitale."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Finge ser una luz guía en el camino, pero en realidad solo quiere absorber la energía vital de quien lo sigue."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"While shining a light and pretending to be a guide, it leeches off the life force of any who follow it."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"明かりを 灯して 道案内を するように 見せかけながら 生命力を 吸い取っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa flamme brûle en consumant l’énergie vitale des gens et des Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La luz que desprende absorbe la energía vital de humanos y Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Litwick shines a light that absorbs the life energy of people and Pokémon, which becomes the fuel that it burns."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ヒトモシの 灯す 明かりは 人や ポケモンの 生命力を 吸い取って 燃えているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il fait semblant de guider ses victimes à la lueur de sa flamme, mais c’est pour mieux aspirer leur énergie vitale."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Finge ser una luz guía en el camino, pero en realidad solo quiere absorber la energía vital de quien lo sigue."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"While shining a light and pretending to be a guide, it leeches off the life force of any who follow it."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"明かりを 灯して 道案内を するように 見せかけながら 生命力を 吸い取っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sa flamme brûle en consumant l’énergie vitale des gens et des Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La luz que desprende absorbe la energía vital de humanos y Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Litwick shines a light that absorbs the life energy of people and Pokémon, which becomes the fuel that it burns."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ヒトモシの 灯す 明かりは 人や ポケモンの 生命力を 吸い取って 燃えているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Son corps est tiède, réchauffé par sa flamme. Il prend les personnes égarées par la main et les guide vers le monde des esprits."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"El calor de la llama hace que su cuerpo esté algo tibio. Toma de la mano a quien se pierde para llevárselo a su mundo de espíritus."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The flame on its head keeps its body slightly warm. This Pokémon takes lost children by the hand to guide them to the spirit world."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"炎で 熱せられた 体は ほんのり 温かい。 迷子の 手を 引き 霊界へと 誘う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Plus les victimes dont il aspire l’énergie vitale sont jeunes, plus sa flamme grandit et luit lugubrement."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuanto más joven sea la energía vital que ha absorbido, mayor tamaño tendrá la llama de la cabeza y más siniestro será su brillo."},